  "title": "GTPv2: Don't loop through the IE Instance vals list with NULL tree",
  "description": "The IE Instance vals list has 250+ members. Since the keys are\nfour uint8_t, it could be made into a value_string_ext, or perhaps\ninto a epan scoped map lazily created the first time it's needed.\n\nIn any case, we don't need to search it when the tree is NULL, and\nright now the proportional impact of performance is quite high when\nthe tree is NULL.",
